WEBVTT

NOTE tts=synthetic

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.233
How to grease a hydraulic breaker

2
00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:08.233
Hold the breaker upright and press the tool fully in against the ground.

3
00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:12.900
Grease through the breaker’s grease nipple, in the amount the manual gives.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:17.900
The grease goes between tool and bushings rather than into the piston area.

5
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:22.933
Too much grease does harm as well: the surplus can fill the impact area.

6
00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:28.400
A tool run dry gets a scored, discoloured shank and the bushings wear fast.
